Consuming a void star, you use it to summon a void monolith at the targeted location for [4, 5, 6, 6, 7 (TL1-5)] turns. The monolith is very durable, and while immobile it will attempt to daze enemies within radius 1 for 2 turns every half a turn using your spellpower.

The monolith will gain [1, 1, 2, 3, 4 (MAG 10-100)] life rating and [15%, 21%, 29%, 35%, 39% (MAG 10-100)] all resist based on your Magic stat.
